  "notes": "USAGE: {優秀|ゆうしゅう} is used to describe people, work, or results that are notably superior to others. It's commonly used in academic and professional contexts.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {優秀|ゆうしゅう}な⟦{学生|がくせい}→学生：00610_gakusei⟧ (excellent student)\n- {優秀|ゆうしゅう}な⟦{成績|せいせき}→成績：03379_seiseki⟧ (excellent grades)\n- {優秀|ゆうしゅう}な⟦{人材|じんざい}→人材：11426_jinzai⟧ (outstanding talent)\n- {優秀|ゆうしゅう}⟦{賞|しょう}→賞：03227_shou⟧ (excellence award)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{優|すぐ}れた→優れる：02119_sugureru⟧ - excellent, superior\n- ⟦{立派|りっぱ}→立派：01093_rippa⟧ - splendid, admirable",
